- Verified against primary sources on 2026-11-14: OpenAI news feed/RSS (last build 2026-11-14 06:42 GMT) contains no GPT-6.2 item; `developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.2-astra` returns 404; the models catalog lists GPT-6 Astra / 6.1 Sol / 6.1 Terra / 6 Luna as flagships.
- All numeric claims found are leak- or scoop-grade (telemetry analyses, Chinese media summaries), not published evaluations; none attaches a benchmark score to the exact `gpt-6.2-astra` ID.
